OL,3,GNEWSASean Graham bookmakers memorial   
OL,4,Avandalised for third time              
OL,6,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland 
OL,7,F(PSNI) said it was treating the        
OL,8,Fincident as a "repeat                  
OL,9,Fsectarian-motivated hate crime",       
OL,10,Ffollowing similar offences in September
OL,11,Fand October.                           
